    "faq_bRPr3Y": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_row_JmcDX6": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's the order process?",
            "row_content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><strong><br/></strong>Create your perfect jerseys using our highly customizable jersey builder, or <a href=\"https://hypercosports.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">contact us</a> to get started.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><strong><br/></strong>Finalize and approve your order details through our proofing portal. We'll send you a link when it's ready.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><strong><br/></strong>Track your order. From approval to shipping, we'll send you updates as we work on your team's unis.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_KCN7xL": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's the minimum order?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our minimum order quantity is as low as 5 jerseys/kits per order. One of the lowest minimums you'll find!</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_Acij7w": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take?",
            "row_content": "<p>You will receive a digital proof within 2 business days of ordering. Once we get your approval,  the production + shipping times are as follows: sublimated hockey jerseys take 4-5 weeks. Embroidered tackle twill takes 5-6 weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_Hya7CR": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much is shipping, and where all do you ship to?",
            "row_content": "<p>We'll ship anywhere! Currently, we offer<strong>$20 worldwide flat rate</strong>shipping for all orders.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_yYnaTM": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I reorder a single jersey later?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, whether you have a new teammate or you just need a new jersey for yourself, all you have to do is fill out a quick form, and we'll get back to you as soon as possible with an invoice and proof.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_NBcqDM": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you have a size chart?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yep!</p><p><a href=\"https://hypercosports.com/pages/hockey-jersey-socks-size-charts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hockey Jersey & Socks Size Charts\">Hockey Jersey & Sock Size Chart<br/><br/></a>Soccer Size Chart (Coming Soon)<br/><br/>Basketball Size Chart (Coming Soon)</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_7YYARx": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer youth and adult sizes?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we offer youth and adult sizes for all all products.<br/><br/>See our full<a href=\"https://hypercosports.com/pages/hockey-jersey-socks-size-charts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hockey Jersey & Sock Size Charts\">size chart here</a>, and select your sizes in the Roster tab of the jersey builder for whichever jersey product you customize.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_AzdtPk": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I can't build the jersey I want on your builder?",
            "row_content": "<p>No problem! Just visit our <a href=\"https://hypercosports.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">Contact</a> page, select Custom Order in the Contact Reason dropdown, and fill in your details. We'll get back to you once we review everything.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_tkKiMK": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer socks?",
            "row_content": "<p>We currently only offer hockey socks. Within the jersey builder for either of the two Ice Hockey Jersey products, you have the option to add & design socks.</p><p>Our socks are made of performance polyester, just like the jerseys.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_wH6KGH": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are logos and names on the back extra?",
            "row_content": "<p>Nope! The price you see includes logos, names, numbers, and whichever jersey pattern you select within the jersey builder.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_KkChE7": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you make me a custom logo?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you need a custom logo, just <a href=\"https://hypercosports.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">reach out to us</a> and we'll gather details from you before supplying a quote.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_3ECbH9": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's your return policy?",
            "row_content": "<p>All custom orders are final and aren't returnable. However, if there's something wrong with your uniforms or you're unhappy for any reason, you can reach out to us and we’ll make it right!</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_row_mfARdH": {
          "type": "faq_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your jerseys printed or stitched?",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer both! Sublimated: All-over printing; embroidered: Sewn-on logos, names, and numbers. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
